@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - Edit Show Request

actor "User" as USER
participant ":System" as System

autonumber

USER -> System : Request to Edit Show Request
activate System

System --> USER : Display list of Show Requests
deactivate System

USER -> System : Select ShowRequest ID
activate System

System --> USER : Display ShowRequest Details
deactivate System

loop For each attribute (Place, Date, Duration, State)
    USER -> System : Provide new value or skip
    activate System
    System --> USER : Confirm update or skip
    deactivate System
end

System --> USER : ShowRequest updated successfully or error message
deactivate System

@enduml
